sequenceDiagram
    participant S as SPIRE Server
    participant A as SPIRE Agent (Node)
    participant E1 as Envoy Sidecar (Service A)
    participant E2 as Envoy Sidecar (Service B)

    note over S, A: Bootstrapping & Attestation
    S->>A: Issues SVIDs (X.509 certs) to Agent
    
    note over A, E1: Dynamic Certificate Provisioning (SDS)
    A->>E1: Pushes Service A SVID via Secret Discovery Service
    A->>E2: Pushes Service B SVID via Secret Discovery Service
    
    note over E1, E2: mTLS Handshake
    E1->>E2: TLS ClientHello
    E2->>E1: TLS ServerHello, Certificate (Service B SVID), CertificateRequest
    E1->>E2: Certificate (Service A SVID), ClientKeyExchange, CertificateVerify
    E2->>E1: Finished
    E1->>E2: Finished
    
    note over E1, E2: Secure Data Transfer (Encrypted & Authenticated)
    E1->>E2: HTTP Request (Over mTLS)
    note over E2: Ext_authz validates SPIFFE ID / JWT
    E2->>E1: HTTP Response
